        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Verizon North Inc. (North Central Region) and the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers, Local 986 agree to develop and implement a Team Performance Award which will provide participating employees the opportunity to earn compensation based upon collective/team performance results.",
