        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All full-time and part-time regular hourly employees are eligible to receive an award if they are on a TPA team for 30 calendar days or more. Employees on other Incentive plans are not eligible, i.e., BSG, Consumer Sales, Retail, LiveSource.",
